64&quot;&gt;Azure File Sync, GRS replication and cross-region balancing&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontColor=#232F3E;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="16" width="1016" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#8C99A6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="576" width="1020" height="164" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legt" value="&lt;b&gt;Flow&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="34" y="584" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lega" value="&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; F5 picks the region.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; Region A serves production.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; Files on Azure Files with File Sync.&lt;br&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="34" y="606" width="490.0" height="57" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legb" value="&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt; Geo-replication to region B.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt; F5 fails over when region A is down.&lt;br&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="536.0" y="606" width="490.0" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legn" value="• ~90 TB; agreed RPO/RTO and cost per option (LRS, ZRS, GRS) in the original drawing.&lt;br&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#545B64;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="34" y="661" width="980" height="23" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k0" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#545B64;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="34" y="715" as="source